# Not used. Nothing in this repo reads this folder's .env or .env.example.
#
# Orpheus settings live in model-server/.env: copy model-server/.env.example
# and edit its Orpheus section (ORPHEUS_*). Compose passes those values into
# the container through tts/orpheus/compose.extra.yml, and they override
# config.yaml.
#
# This file used to hold upstream's settings for its own docker-compose.yml,
# which was never vendored here, so editing it changed nothing.
